{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2023-03-03 17:45:00', 'title': 'HII HOSTS CHIEF OF NAVAL OPERATIONS ADM. MICHAEL GILDAY AT NEWPORT NEWS SHIPBUILDING', 'text': "NEWPORT NEWS, VA., MARCH 03, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HII (NYSE: HII) HOSTED CHIEF OF NAVAL OPERATIONS ADM. MICHAEL GILDAY FOR A VISIT TO THE COMPANY'S NEWPORT NEWS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION ON THURSDAY DURING A SCHEDULED VISIT TO HAMPTON ROADS. WHILE IN NEWPORT NEWS, GILDAY MET WITH NNS LEADERSHIP AND TOURED THE SHIPYARD."}